# Week 2 — Stakeholders & Requirements Elicitation

## 1. Stakeholders

1. **Students** (Direct User)
2. **Lecturers / Teaching Staff** (Direct User)
3. **Equipment Technicians / Equipment Managers** (Direct User)
4. **IT Support** (Direct User / Administrator)
5. **Security Team** (Indirect Stakeholder)
6. **College Management** (Sponsor / Indirect Stakeholder)
7. **Equipment Suppliers** (External Stakeholder)

