## 2. Stakeholder Needs & Concerns

| Stakeholder | Role / User Type | Possible Need | Possible Concern |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Student** | Direct User | Fast access to real-time equipment availability. | Being unable to get required equipment when needed for assignments. |
| **Lecturer** | Direct User | Guaranteed availability of teaching equipment for scheduled classes. | Equipment not being available at the required time, disrupting lectures. |
| **Equipment Technician** | Direct User | Clear visibility of items due out, returned, or overdue. | Equipment being returned late, damaged, or going missing without records. |
| **Equipment Manager** | Direct User / Admin | Maintain full accountability and track asset usage. | Equipment being lost, stolen, or used without prior authorization. |
| **IT Support** | Technical Maintainer | Clear access control rules, security measures, and system reliability. | System security breaches, unauthorized access, or high administrative overhead. |

