## 7. Candidate Requirements

### Functional Requirements
* **FR01:** The system shall allow an authorized user to request equipment for a specified date and time.
* **FR02:** The system shall display real-time availability of equipment for a specified date and time range.
* **FR03:** The system shall record equipment bookings and prevent double-booking of the same item.
* **FR04:** The system shall record when equipment is checked out and returned by a technician.
* **FR05:** The system shall flag and track overdue items and notify the responsible technician.

### Non-Functional Requirements
* **NFR01:** The system shall restrict access to booking management features based on user roles (Student, Lecturer, Technician, Admin).
* **NFR02:** The system shall protect user personal data and booking history from unauthorized access in compliance with data privacy policies.
* **NFR03:** The system shall be available 99% of the time during operational college hours to allow checking and making bookings.



























